    "source_semantics": [
      "diff compares node descriptor PartialEq and removed keys in BTreeMap key order; caller guarantees same tree identity; root list equality alone not diffed or applied",
      "capacity prescan repeats comparison predicates, benchmark measures only Vec reserve/push not snapshot comparison or end-to-end replacement; ignored benchmark not run",
      "route owns binding and shares optional Arc handler; callbacks consume context and produce owned JSON/error, no panic containment guarantee; actual registration/invocation pins reused correctly",
      "UiModule descriptor stores factories; Core invokes them at immediate startup, module Input/Scene/Graphics and manager->driver dependencies; cleanup closes existing-driver admission only",
      "driver snapshots config, default only missing whole config, invalid config emitted then Core wraps factory error as Initialization; Acquire/Release is admission gate, no asset work/surface drain guarantee",
      "project empty roots bypass driver; otherwise enter driver and admit before asset manager load; false skips UI roots; handle guard remains during this function",
      "cleanup capability only already initialized stopping/drained matching driver; callback outside locks, no service resurrection or Arc escape",
      "test cleanup wrapper runs real hook then observes address and closed flag; retained guards dropped before stop; reactivation compares index/generation, no address-reuse assertion",
      "root BUG: fixed invalid enabled-string test expects ConfigParse after only optional rollback extraction; Core has already stringified it into Initialization, so first assert statically fails and following driver-resolve assert is blocked"
    ],
